WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.285
- America, what happened?

00:00:02.285 --> 00:00:05.695
Why did this whole debacle

00:00:05.695 --> 00:00:08.455
of a election occur?

00:00:08.455 --> 00:00:12.985
(upbeat music)

00:00:14.595 --> 00:00:16.350
- What I know about Donald Trump

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:17.809
is that he has terrible hair.

00:00:17.809 --> 00:00:20.349
- Angry orange orangutan thing.

00:00:20.349 --> 00:00:23.309
- You know, he's scary,
he's actually really scary.

00:00:23.309 --> 00:00:24.969
- He's racist.

00:00:24.969 --> 00:00:27.650
- Most people my age
think that this is a joke.

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:30.369
- Maybe Americans are too
used to reality television.

00:00:30.369 --> 00:00:33.810
- I lived in Toronto in
2010, which is when Rob Ford

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:37.209
was elected mayor, and
this feels very similar.

00:00:37.209 --> 00:00:40.030
- I love reality TV, but
I just wouldn't think

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:42.469
that anybody from Vanderpump Rules,

00:00:42.469 --> 00:00:44.609
for example, would go run for office.

00:00:44.609 --> 00:00:47.168
- We were all, in Toronto,
we were all really sure

00:00:47.168 --> 00:00:50.288
that Rob Ford could not and
would not ever be elected mayor.

00:00:50.288 --> 00:00:52.248
- Do you think this is funny?

00:00:52.248 --> 00:00:54.608
- As a Canadian I'm a
little surprised by it.

00:00:54.608 --> 00:00:56.808
- People were encouraging Rob Ford to run

00:00:56.808 --> 00:00:58.368
'cause they thought it would be funny.

00:00:58.368 --> 00:01:01.448
- Are you planning to move
to another part of the world?

00:01:01.448 --> 00:01:03.009
- Running to Canada.

00:01:03.009 --> 00:01:04.588
- Where are you gonna live in Canada?

00:01:04.588 --> 00:01:06.728
- If moving is not gonna
solve your problems,

00:01:06.728 --> 00:01:08.668
mainly because you know
you're right next door,

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:10.648
Trump will be right next door.

00:01:10.648 --> 00:01:14.048
- So it's not a guarantee of escape.

00:01:14.048 --> 00:01:15.588
- Dear Americans,

00:01:15.588 --> 00:01:16.908
- Dear Americans,

00:01:16.908 --> 00:01:18.088
- Dear Americans,

00:01:18.088 --> 00:01:19.802
- Make sure you vote,
because your vote counts.

00:01:19.802 --> 00:01:23.122
- It's time to be vigilant
and to participate.

00:01:23.122 --> 00:01:25.442
- Do whatever it takes,
fight 'til the end.

00:01:25.442 --> 00:01:27.262
- If you need us, we're there for you.

00:01:27.262 --> 00:01:29.762
- Good luck, to all of us.

00:01:29.762 --> 00:01:34.512
(upbeat music)

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:37.582
It's not funny.

00:01:38.882 --> 00:01:40.780
It's not funny.

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:42.158
I know.

00:01:42.158 --> 00:01:44.408
Laughing 'cause it's scary.

